# Cache rules for Cloudflare Pages.
# Rules run in file order and a repeated Cache-Control would be joined with
# a comma, so the /assets/* block first detaches the catch-all value (!)
# and then sets its own. Versioned asset URLs (?v=<content hash>, injected
# at build time in GamePage.astro) make the long immutable rule safe: any
# bank/language-pack change ships under a new URL, so a browser can never
# pair a stale cached pack with a fresh page.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
